WEBVTT

NOTE
Squall and Rinoa reunited in space — Rinoa revived.
Duration: approximately 18 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.780
Squall holds Rinoa close, their helmets pressed together against the stars.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.350
Rinoa's face eases as she comes back to consciousness.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.480
The shot fades to the black of space.
